  License:       GNU General Public License v3.0 or later (see LICENSE)

Modifications (2026-09-19 to 2026-09-21):
  - Renamed theme to "Velo" (Theme-Id "velo").
  - Lock screen: top/bottom gradient scrims, outline options, message icon on one line.
  - Login screen: optional translucent card, bottom scrim, clock/date options.
  - Split into smaller modules: components/Scrim.qml, LoginCard.qml, LoginHeader.qml.
  - New keys in configs/default.conf and components/Config.qml (scrims, card, slideshow-interval,
    the six [Tooltips] texts, ...).
  - Background slideshow: `background` may list several images separated by `|` and they rotate
    every `slideshow-interval` seconds (Main.qml, components/Config.qml).
  - Translations of the theme's own texts into the languages SDDM ships (gui/velo_idiomas.py).
  - Presets in configs/presets/ (partial configuration files).
  - Added gui/ (graphical editor for the config, Python + GTK 3, "Apply to system" through a
    terminal with sudo) and backgrounds/default.jpg (own generated fallback image).
  - Debian/Ubuntu install.sh (drop-in /etc/sddm.conf.d/velo.conf) replaces the original one.
  - Removed Nix packaging, docs and the original extra presets.

